{"id":"2e668662ec71d852","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md","title":"ZFC Quotient Set","display":"df-zfc-quotient-set — ZFC Quotient Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-quotient-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-quotient-set","58-df-zfc-order7-quotient-set","58-df-zfc-rel-quotient-set","58-df-zfc-setop-quotient-set"],"display":"df-zfc-quotient-set — ZFC Quotient Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-equivalence-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-quotient-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-quotient-set</span><span>58-df-zfc-order7-quotient-set</span><span>58-df-zfc-rel-quotient-set</span><span>58-df-zfc-setop-quotient-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-quotient-set — ZFC Quotient Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"58-df-equivalence-relation\">58-df-equivalence-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,A,Q\\in V\">\\(R,A,Q\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（参数顺序为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(R,A)\">\\((R,A)\\)</span>，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"58-df-equivalence-relation\">58-df-equivalence-relation</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,A,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(R,A)\\land\nQ=\\{\\{y\\in A\\mid\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}\\mid x\\in A\\}\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,A,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(R,A)\\land\nQ=\\{\\{y\\in A\\mid\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}\\mid x\\in A\\}\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-order7-quotient-set</code>, <code>58-df-zfc-rel-quotient-set</code>, and <code>58-df-zfc-setop-quotient-set</code> are merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-equivalence-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equivalence-relation","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\subseteq V^2$（参数顺序为 $(R,A)$，see [[58-df-equivalence-relation]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,A,Q\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"(R,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,A,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(R,A)\\land\nQ=\\{\\{y\\in A\\mid\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\}\\mid x\\in A\\}\n\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":949,"backlinks":[{"id":"3a32009d673e1bd4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(R,C,E)$ 使用 [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md]]。"},{"id":"a1ff3249e9f48b08","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3e2e6a2f5d909f84","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Q\\in V$；$\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,P,E)$ 使用 [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md]]。"},{"id":"9ced46394294c1a6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (canonical quotient predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-quotient-set]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3215","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md|58-df-zfc-quotient-set]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["908bc7b079f5d25b"]}